{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-aa6e098b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2012.01581 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2012.01581 measures 3 observables: 1. 95% CL exclusion limit on gluino/top-squark mass as a function of mean proper decay length 2. 95% CL upper limit on LLP pair production cross section 3. 95% CL upper limit on branching fraction of SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles. This information is supported by the following evidence from the paper: - 'The 95% CL exclusion limit on the gluino/top-squark mass as a function of the mean proper decay length is shown in Fig. 10.' - 'The 95% CL upper limit on the LLP pair production cross section is shown in Fig. 11.' - 'The 95% CL upper limit on the branching fraction of the SM-like Higgs boson to two long-lived scalar particles is shown in Fig. 12.' Therefore, the analysis 2012.01581 measures 3 observables.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.01581"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.01581"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:llp_mass_exclusion_limit", "hepkg:observable:pair_production_cross_section_ul"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:104565d247f69631012d1150", "hepkg:evidence:4b689d2927aa533f3d8befb9", "hepkg:evidence:4c49ce1f0448f40ecbf32917", "hepkg:evidence:88c97278475bc50386f1c50d", "hepkg:evidence:c32553f56405c11c0fb1dd56", "hepkg:evidence:d82881bb85805d28153f7b5f", "hepkg:evidence:dc32fda856c72c452dfda338", "hepkg:evidence:fadbe46181788a2bf6155713"], "seen_values": ["2012.01581", "95", "boson", "branching", "cross", "decay", "exclusion", "fraction", "function", "gluino", "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:llp_mass_exclusion_limit", "hepkg:observable:pair_production_cross_section_ul", "higgs", "length", "limit", "llp", "long-lived", "mass", "mean", "observable", "pair", "particles", "production", "proper", "result_measures_observable", "scalar", "section", "sm-like", "top-squark", "two", "upper"], "verification_score": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": ["11", "12"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 8938, "completion_tokens": 507, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 38.17569820815697, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 38.17569820815697, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9445.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.5, "unsupported_claims": 2.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 8.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-aaa44d75", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2404.06204 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( W \\rightarrow e \\nu \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( W \\rightarrow \\mu \\nu \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( Z \\rightarrow ee \\) selection\n- Detector-level signal region for \\( Z \\rightarrow \\mu \\mu \\) selection\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for \\( W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\) cross-section measurement\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) cross-section measurement\n- \\( W \\rightarrow l \\nu \\) multijet background 'fit region' (relaxed \\( E_T^{miss} \\) and \\( m_T \\), inverted isolation)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow ee \\) multijet control region C (fail Medium, pass Loose ID, same-charge pairs, \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) multijet control region B (subleading lepton fails isolation)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow l l \\) multijet control region D (combined B and C modifications)\n- \\( Z \\rightarrow \\mu \\mu \\) multijet control region C (same-charge muon pairs, \\( p_T > 20 \\) GeV)\n\nThese regions are used to define the selection criteria for the various decay channels in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-lnu-fiducial", "hepkg:region:w-mj-fit-region", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr", "hepkg: