{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-aac56f90", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2110.11231 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2110.11231 measures the following observables:\n\n- Anomalous coupling \\( c_b/\\Lambda^2 \\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\) tail\n- Anomalous coupling \\( c_w/\\Lambda^2 \\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\) tail\n- Anomalous coupling \\( c_{www}/\\Lambda^2 \\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\) tail\n- CP-violating anomalous coupling \\( \\tilde{c}_w/\\Lambda^2 \\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\) tail\n- CP-violating anomalous coupling \\( \\tilde{c}_{www}/\\Lambda^2 \\) constraint from \\( M(WZ) \\) tail\n- Charge asymmetry ratio \\( A^{+-}_{WZ} = \\sigma_{\\text{fid}}(W+Z)/\\sigma_{\\text{fid}}(W-Z) \\)\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs \\( \\cos(\\theta_W) \\) polarization angle\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs \\( \\cos(\\theta_Z) \\) polarization angle\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs invariant mass \\( M(WZ) \\)\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs jet multiplicity\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs \\( p_T(Z \\text{ boson}) \\)\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs \\( p_T(\\text{leading jet}) \\)\n- Differential \\( WZ \\) cross section vs \\( p_T(\\text{lepton from W decay}) \\)\n- Fiducial \\( WZ \\) production cross section (particle-level fiducial region)\n- Significance of longitudinally polarized \\( W \\) boson observation in \\( WZ \\) production\n- Significance of longitudinally polarized \\( Z \\) boson observation in \\( WZ \\) production\n- Total \\( WZ \\) production cross section (no detector acceptance, total region)\n- \\( W \\) boson left-right polarization asymmetry \\( f_{LR}^W = f_L - f_R \\) (helicity frame)\n- \\( W \\) boson longitudinal polarization fraction \\( f_0^W \\) (helicity frame)\n- \\( Z \\) boson left-right polarization asymmetry \\( f_{LR}^Z = f_L - f_R \\) (helicity frame)\n- \\( Z \\) boson longitudinal polarization fraction \\( f_0^Z \\) (helicity frame)\n\nThese observables cover a range of measurements related to the production and properties of \\( WZ \\) events.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:atgc-cb-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-costheta-w", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-costheta-z", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-jet-multiplicity", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-mwz", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-leading-jet", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-w-lepton", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-z", "hepkg:observable:w-longitudinal-polarization-significance", "hepkg:observable:w-polarization-f0", "hepkg:observable:w-polarization-flr", "hepkg:observable:wz-charge-asymmetry-ratio", "hepkg:observable:wz-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:wz-total-xsec", "hepkg:observable:z-longitudinal-polarization-significance", "hepkg:observable:z-polarization-f0", "hepkg:observable:z-polarization-flr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:03f19bf4c3f7dfc927c463ef", "hepkg:evidence:13d2bdf84ff6866ea62c404b", "hepkg:evidence:16d683b600d8adfb05e4dcc8", "hepkg:evidence:3902a432844df0ab9c6b459e", "hepkg:evidence:3d458743d1f09fe6f423175f", "hepkg:evidence:474afc32f170fa3d8aed366f", "hepkg:evidence:4eae90de185f21c83fe78414", "hepkg:evidence:5345dcc577c6ef4fe8e5f927", "hepkg:evidence:5de47d7a41dfa1f248bf3d93", "hepkg:evidence:5df7b6d0ae72eca6f28cd299", "hepkg:evidence:607590815f4a1d28cca994fc", "hepkg:evidence:65018e54562eb98