{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-ae86282d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2401.05299 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2401.05299 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $V$+jets sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- $tZ$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8)\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ sub-leading EWK real-emission sample (Sherpa 2.2.10, LO QCD)\n- $t\\bar{t}WW, WtZ, t\\bar{t}t, tHjb, WtH$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8)\n- $t\\bar{t}\\to W^{+}bW^{-}\\bar{b}\\ell^{+}\\ell^{-}$ radiative-decay sample (LO ME)\n- $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$ sample (MG5_aMC NLO + Pythia 8)\n- Alternative $t\\bar{t}W$ sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.9.3 FxFx, NNPDF3.1nnlo)\n- Alternative $t\\bar{t}W$ sample (Powheg Box + Herwig 7)\n- Alternative $t\\bar{t}W$ sample (Powheg Box + Pythia 8)\n- Alternative inclusive $t\\bar{t}W$ sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.210)\n- Diboson fully-leptonic sample (Sherpa 2.2.2)\n- Diboson semileptonic sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- EWK $VVjj$ sample (Sherpa 2.2.2)\n- Nominal $t\\bar{t}$ and single-top sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.230)\n- Nominal $t\\bar{t}H$ sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.230)\n- Nominal $t\\bar{t}W$ sample (Sherpa 2.2.10, NLO QCD merged, NNPDF3.0nnlo)\n- Nominal $t\\bar{t}Z/\\gamma^{*}$ sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.8.1 + Pythia 8.244)\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799", "2401.05299", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.05299"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:ewk-vvjj-sherpa", "hepkg:sample:rare-mg5", "hepkg:sample:tt-radiative-mg5", "hepkg:sample:tt-singletop-nominal-powheg", "hepkg:sample:tth-nominal-pow