{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-ae9855bf", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2102.01444 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 contains the following event regions:\n\n- **Control Regions (CR):**\n  - CR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t}\\): two-body \\(t\\bar t\\) control region\n  - CR\\(^{3-body}_{VV}\\): three-body diboson control region\n  - CR\\(^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}\\): three-body \\(t\\bar t\\) control region\n  - CR\\(^{4-body}_{VV}\\): four-body diboson control region\n  - CR\\(^{4-body}_{t\\bar t}\\): four-body \\(t\\bar t\\) control region\n  - CR\\(^{FNP}\\): fake/non-prompt lepton control region used to derive fake factors for all selections\n  - CR\\(_{t\\bar t Z}\\): \\(t\\bar t Z\\) control region (shared by two-body and three-body selections)\n\n- **Signal Regions (SR):**\n  - SR\\(^{2-body}_{[x,\\infty)}\\): two-body inclusive signal region (DF+SF combined, model-independent limits)\n  - SR\\(^{4-body}_{Large\\, \\Delta m}\\): four-body signal region for larger \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t_1,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\)\n  - SR\\(^{4-body}_{Small\\, \\Delta m}\\): four-body signal region for small \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t_1,\\tilde\\chi_1^0)\\)\n  - SR-DF\\(^{2-body}_{[x,y)}\\): two-body binned signal regions, different-flavour leptons, binned in \\(m_{T2}^{\\ell\\ell}\\)\n  - SR-DF\\(^{3-body}_{W}\\): three-body signal region targeting \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0) \\sim m(W)\\), different-flavour leptons\n  - SR-DF\\(^{3-body}_{t}\\): three-body signal region targeting \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0) \\sim m(t)\\), different-flavour leptons\n  - SR-SF\\(^{2-body}_{[x,y)}\\): two-body binned signal regions, same-flavour leptons, binned in \\(m_{T2}^{\\ell\\ell}\\)\n  - SR-SF\\(^{3-body}_{W}\\): three-body signal region targeting \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0) \\sim m(W)\\), same-flavour leptons\n  - SR-SF\\(^{3-body}_{t}\\): three-body signal region targeting \\(\\Delta m(\\tilde t,\\tilde\\chi_1^0) \\sim m(t)\\), same-flavour leptons\n\n- **Validation Regions (VR):**\n  - VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t Z}\\): two-body \\(t\\bar t Z\\) validation region (four-lepton)\n  - VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,DF}\\): two-body \\(t\\bar t\\) validation region, different-flavour leptons\n  - VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,SF}\\): two-body \\(t\\bar t\\) validation region, same-flavour leptons\n  - VR\\(^{3-body}_{VV}\\): three-body diboson validation region\n  - VR\\(^{4-body}_{VV,3\\ell}\\): four-body diboson validation region (three-lepton)\n  - VR\\(^{4-body}_{VV}\\): four-body diboson validation region (two-lepton)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-fnp", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:sr-2body-inclusive", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-largedm", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-smalldm", "hepkg:region:sr-df-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-w", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-w", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-df", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-sf", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:vr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv-3l", "hepkg:region:vr1-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr2-3body-ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:16f11bfe0deafa4d579d2f76", "hepkg:evidence:1f66d86402874c5f9d15431d", "hepkg:evidence:2ddd55d23b55f5487fc01492", "hepkg:evidence:39f8d8494cb30470c026db90", "hepkg:evidence:429f33ad978b0e5a5f7fd507", "hepkg:evidence:450d3f92b3c4d6d5076a944f", "hepkg:evidence:4b39fe7df12fd6e1debb2587", "hepkg:evidence:7685312af774c55c6a3946ad", "hepkg:evidence:7a16f95034e5a30fde98787b", "hepkg:evidence:7bcd640abeab24e10e9bc7ee", "hepkg:evidence:a5dbb605f67821c684d9927a", "hepkg:evidence:cade7c3526615793a6372c0a", "hepkg:evidence:f11b3714647c4177b00c746e", "hepkg:evidence:fb74b41dd0719569e9ea8573"], "seen_values": ["-body", "-jet", "0", "1", "2", "2102.01444", "3", "4", "all", "and", "bar", "binned", "channel_has_region", "chi_1", "combined", "control", "delta", "derive", "diboson", "different-flavour", "ell", "event_region", "factors", "fake", "fnp", "for", "four-body", "four-lepton", "geq1", "hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:cr-fnp", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarz", "hepkg:region:sr-2body-inclusive", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-largedm", "hepkg:region:sr-4body-smalldm", "hepkg:region:sr-df-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-df-3body-w", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-2body", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-t", "hepkg:region:sr-sf-3body-w", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-df", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-sf", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbarz", "hepkg:region:vr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv-3l", "hepkg:region:vr1-3body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:vr2-3body-ttbar", "inclusive", "infty", "large", "larger", "lepton", "leptons", "limits", "model-independent", "non-prompt", "region", "regions", "requiring", "same-flavour", "selections", "shared", "signal", "sim", "small", "sr-df", "sr-sf", "t_1", "targeting", "three-body", "three-lepton", "tilde", "two-body", "two-lepton", "used", "validation", "veto", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 10807, "completion_tokens": 838, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 54.200202526059, "revi