{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-af161d13", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2010.14293 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2010.14293 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Control-region data statistical uncertainty (CR sample size)\n- Diboson ($WZ$/$ZZ$+jets) modelling uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES), jet energy resolution (JER) and \\(E_T^\\text{miss}\\) soft-term uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction and b-tag/b-veto efficiency uncertainty (found negligible)\n- MC background sample statistical (limited-event) uncertainty\n- Multi-jet background estimate uncertainty (uniform 100%)\n- Pile-up reweighting uncertainty (found negligible)\n- SUSY signal ISR/FSR modelling uncertainty (generator tune and scale variation, function of mass splitting)\n- SUSY signal cross-section uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scale, PDF, \\(\\alpha_s\\) variation)\n- Statistical uncertainty in \\(\\gamma\\)+jets-to-\\(Z\\)+jets kappa correction factor\n- Theoretical modelling uncertainty from generator comparison and renormalisation/factorisation scale variation\n- W/Z+jets modelling uncertainty (CKKW-L merging/resummation scale, PDF, \\(\\alpha_s\\), ME scale variations)\n- \\(t\\bar{t}\\) background modelling uncertainty (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations)\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis and contribute to the overall uncertainty in the results.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2010.14293"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:cr-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:diboson-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer-met", "hepkg:systematic:kappa-factor-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-btag-reco", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:multijet-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-reweighting", "hepkg:systematic:signal-cross-section", "hepkg:systematic:signal-isr-fsr", "hepkg:systematic:theory-scale-variation", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:wz-jets-modelling"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:22ffa66d1106c9e05fb8e211", "hepkg:evidence:27fdef5c1d7ccbf9c7cde2eb", "hepkg:evidence:2aa2dd013c53d60bb2537317", "hepkg:evidence:2ed52b0a45ad6923e13ce864", "hepkg:evidence:4f2eee6b73aa676d84f7a3cf", "hepkg:evidence:52c4950da75a855739ac0568", "hepkg:evidence:753512fc61802b22c7455f66", "hepkg:evidence:7ab7a5abac5b107f9100c9a8", "hepkg:evidence:95b51c4b9cacad93fbedb2ca", "hepkg:evidence:b64104da987adc4fd2db46c0", "hepkg:evidence:bfc7251133b16ceddea45f27", "hepkg:evidence:c0022f3f2871ad8bafd72568", "hepkg:evidence:cf8c0b154b6cb3dca4a3e8d3", "hepkg:evidence:d8eb9b93d11d1eb67e5cffc8"], "seen_values": ["1", "100", "2010.14293", "alpha_s", "and", "b-tag", "b-veto", "background", "choice", "ckkw-l", "comparison", "control-region", "correction", "cross-section", "data", "diboson", "e_t", "efficiency", "energy", "estimate", "factor", "factorisation", "found", "from", "fsr", "function", "gamma", "generator", "hadronisation", "hepkg:systematic:cr-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:diboson-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer-met", "hepkg:systematic:kappa-factor-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-bt