{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b218870f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2312.04450 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2312.04450 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $WZ$+jets background ($WZ+b$, $WZ+c$, $WZ+l$)\n- $Z$+jets background ($Z+b$, $Z+c$, $Z+l$)\n- $ZZ$+jets background ($ZZ+b$, $ZZ+c$, $ZZ+l$)\n- $tWZ$ background\n- $tZq$ background\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ background\n- $t\\bar{t}W$ background\n- Diboson background (2$\\ell$OS channel, combined)\n- Dileptonic $t\\bar{t}$ background (2$\\ell$OS channel)\n- Fake/non-prompt (F/NP) lepton background\n- Minor rare backgrounds ($HV$, $VVV$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $tt\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2312.04450.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "hepkg:background:fake-nonprompt-leptons", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:ttbar-2lOS", "hepkg:background:tth", "hepkg:background:ttw", "hepkg:background:twz", "hepkg:background:tzq", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:z-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:zz-plus-jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0eff76be0486fe089d44cabc", "hepkg:evidence:223f405d8e0103a3cab4f175", "hepkg:evidence:385bece767c98f46171b75c9", "hepkg:evidence:78c46868643f9acbe5287bb5", "hepkg:evidence:7b6347e77d7fd41907a7b872", "hepkg:evidence:90f241963b4eada254303cfa", "hepkg:evidence:ac202d14e5c4b2081275d2d5", "hepkg:evidence:dacedec8dda0b0c770a008bd"], "seen_values": ["