{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b220306e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2205.05120 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2205.05120 measures the following observables:\n\n- \\( \\alpha^{\\text{Hff}} \\) (effective Hff CP-odd mixing angle)\n- \\( c_{\\text{gg}} \\) (EFT Higgs-basis ggH coupling)\n- \\( c_{\\text{gg}}^{\\text{tilde}} \\) (EFT Higgs-basis CP-odd ggH coupling)\n- \\( f_{\\text{CP}}^{\\text{Htt}} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{\\text{Z}\\gamma} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\text{a2}} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\text{a3}} \\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\text{a3}}^{\\text{ggH}} \\) (Hgg CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n\nThese observables are related to various couplings and mixing angles in the context of Higgs physics.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2205.05120 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- \\( \\\\alpha^{\\\\text{Hff}} \\\\) (effective Hff CP-odd mixing angle)\\n- \\( c_{\\\\text{gg}} \\\\) (EFT Higgs-basis ggH coupling)\\n- \\( c_{\\\\text{gg}}^{\\\\text{tilde}} \\\\) (EFT Higgs-basis CP-odd ggH coupling)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\text{CP}}^{\\\\text{Htt}} \\\\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\Lambda1} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\Lambda1}^{\\\\text{Z}\\\\gamma} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\text{a2}} \\\\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\text{a3}} \\\\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section)\\n- \\( f_{\\\\text{a3}}^{\\\\text{ggH}} \\\\) (Hgg CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\\n\\nThese observables are related to various couplings and mixing angles in the context of Higgs physics.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2205.05120"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:parameter:alpha_hff", "hepkg:parameter:c_gg", "hepkg:parameter:c_gg_tilde", "hepkg:parameter:f_a2", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3_ggh", "hepkg:parameter:f_cp_htt", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1_zgamma"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:065343d1e15396d49e3df8b5", "hepkg:evidence:0a09cb118fd777022bda9ca6", "hepkg:evidence:11f2a493e6a392fd7947df42", "hepkg:evidence:12efc303538c41d184d921e7", "hepkg:evidence:2139beb39b5c223ab1482bc1", "hepkg:evidence:23ed416c4364c76511271a48", "hepkg:evidence:2527f1d02dffc8c900a4419c", "hepkg:evidence:2adcadbe01296a93e205234d", "hepkg:evidence:2bab38bf768c0057529e6c63", "hepkg:evidence:2d4cc74c34870bedf49075bb", "hepkg:evidence:4071e9edc67f7fb3c5642811", "hepkg:evidence:46430b154761a36855ff826b", "hepkg:evidence:55f48bab92c6be1b618ba7d1", "hepkg:evidence:5950910ef99dbfdbc41e20d5", "hepkg:evidence:5b2edcbf35001988cd715bb4", "hepkg:evidence:5e4cbbc4a185027bd205bcd3", "hepkg:evidence:6479fd245787256289ddcda6", "hepkg:evidence:649f21ff33350fe6decdd283", "hepkg:evidence:67ab515a2cba0b2ab2b60655", "hepkg:evidence:6a2d29985d3c7788b1ecbd51", "hepkg:evidence:6bf328ba4dea221907d8349f", "hepkg:evidence:6e25b40798166a9c32149095", "hepkg:evidence:6ef0d48f4a3da400d118ebc6", "hepkg:evidence:75d78cc7050836b4bc4f71fe", "hepkg:evidence:8b0e126a7677796c8dc3cf3d", "hepkg:evidence:a7d842c84c213f7a394f609d", "hepkg:evidence:b873607464a3eeed44a3fb55", "hepkg:evidence:b89d38868f8c5371e2123e1b", "hepkg:evidence:c0422078403c2e897c67c82c", "hepkg:evidence:c2300c0e