{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b35170f5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2004.14060 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.14060 measures 3 observables:\n\n1. 95% CL upper limit on the number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95)\n2. 95% CL upper limit on the visible BSM cross section (σ_vis = ⟨εσ⟩_obs^95)\n3. Discovery p-value p(s=0) and local significance (Z) for the background-only hypothesis\n\nThese are the observables that the analysis reports measuring.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2004.14060 measures 3 observables:\\n\\n1. 95% CL upper limit on the number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95)\\n2. 95% CL upper limit on the visible BSM cross section (σ_vis = ⟨εσ⟩_obs^95)\\n3. Discovery p-value p(s=0) and local significance (Z) for the background-only hypothesis\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:local_significance", "hepkg:observable:signal_event_limit", "hepkg:observable:visible_cross_section_limit"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3b06056588fb280a99cd14e9", "hepkg:evidence:49ddfdb21badebb3414b057d", "hepkg:evidence:4b67c7b32d335f52e2316ff7"], "seen_values": ["0", "2004.1406", "2004.14060", "95", "and", "background-only", "bsm", "cross", "discovery", "epsilon", "events", "for", "hepkg:observable:local_significance", "hepkg:observable:signal_event_limit", "hepkg:observable:visible_cross_section_limit", "hypothesis", "langle", "limit", "local", "num