{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b3d35a81", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many physics processes does analysis 2012.03799 target?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2012.03799 targets 5 physics processes:\n\n1. Direct stop pair production, \\( pp \\rightarrow \\tilde{t}_1 \\tilde{t}_1^* \\)\n2. Four-body stop decay, \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b f f' \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n3. Three-body stop decay, \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b W \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n4. Two-body stop decay, \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow t + \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\n5. \\( pp \\rightarrow t \\bar{t} + \\) spin-0 mediator (\\( \\phi/a \\rightarrow \\chi \\bar{\\chi} \\))\n\nThese processes are supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"Direct stop pair production, \\( pp \\rightarrow \\tilde{t}_1 \\tilde{t}_1^* \\)\"\n- \"Four-body stop decay \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b f f' \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\"\n- \"Three-body stop decay \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow b W \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\"\n- \"Two-body stop decay \\( \\tilde{t}_1 \\rightarrow t + \\tilde{\\chi}_1^0 \\)\"\n- \"pp -> t tbar + spin-0 mediator (φ/a -> χχ̄)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2012.03799 targets 5 distinct physics processes.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2012.03799 targets 5 physics processes: 1. Direct stop pair production, \\( pp \\\\rightarrow \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\tilde{t}_1^* \\) 2. Four-body stop decay, \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow b f f' \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\) 3. Three-body stop decay, \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow b W \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\) 4. Two-body stop decay, \\( \\\\tilde{t}_1 \\\\rightarrow t + \\\\tilde{\\\\chi}_1^0 \\) 5. \\( pp \\\\rightarrow t \\\\bar{t} + \\\\) spin-0 mediator (\\( \\\\phi/a \\\\rightarrow \\\\chi \\\\bar{\\\\chi} \\))\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2012.03799", "2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:stop-decay-2body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-3body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-4body", "hepkg:process:stop-pair-production", "hepkg:process:ttbar-plus-mediator"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0bb10e9422258c776430f16c", "hepkg:evidence:456eae81bd2f10544b46c954", "hepkg:evidence:74acb271af5d8432cb03e9f8", "hepkg:evidence:8d8bcafa07c0bf03f3428ebf", "hepkg:evidence:9d65dce1ab7bb96a52e46e5b"], "seen_values": ["0", "1", "2012.03799", "decay", "direct", "four-body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-2body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-3body", "hepkg:process:stop-decay-4body", "hepkg:process:stop-pair-production", "hepkg:process:ttbar-plus-mediator", "mediator", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "result_targets_process", "spin-0", "stop", "tbar", "three-body", "two-body"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9031, "completion_tokens": 603, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 28.701890415046364, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 28.701890415046364, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9634.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 5.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b3d5df9e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2007.02873 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2007.02873 measures the following observables:\n\n- One-dimensional 68%/95% CL intervals on SMEFT Warsaw-basis Wilson coefficients affecting VH production and H→bb decay\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for VH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for WH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for ZH, H→bb production\n- Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection, dijet-mass cross-check analysis\n- VH production signal strength μ_VH^bb (H→bb, combined 0+1+2-lepton channels, BDT_VH multivariate analysis)\n- VH signal strength μ_VH^bb from dijet-mass (m_bb) cross-check analysis\n- VH, V→leptons production cross-section times H→bb branching fraction in reduced STXS regions\n- VZ, Z→bb diboson signal strength μ_VZ^bb (BDT_VZ diboson validation analysis)\n- WH production signal strength μ_WH^bb (H→bb, joint two-POI fit)\n- ZH production signal strength μ_ZH^bb (H→bb, joint two-POI fit)\n\nThese observables cover various aspects of VH production and H→bb decay, including signal strengths, significance of background rejection, and cross-sections.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2007.02873"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:vh_stxs_xsec_br", "hepkg:observable:wh_significance", "hepkg:observable:zh_significance"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:51403597c0aa3b992fc87d37", "hepkg:evidence:65f716daf055c0f6bd4039a2", "hepkg:evidence:a336a2433d61e2023093e86b", "hepkg:evidence:cbe22bedd358040617d5ec93", "hepkg:evidence:e0353a2273a92ba04234bcab", "hepkg:evidence:ea65c0cd9824380b5c4a1655", "hepkg:evidence:f73e74afc6b46af577977d19", "hepkg:evidence:fbc49c59afd5d19ff1fe11c5"], "seen_values": ["-lepton", "0", "1", "2", "2007.02873", "68", "95", "_vh", "_vz", "_wh", "_zh", "affecting", "analysis", "and", "background-only", "bdt_vh", "bdt_vz", "branching", "channels", "coefficients", "combined", "cross-check", "cross-section", "decay", "diboson", "dijet-mass", "fit", "for", "fraction", "from", "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance", "hepkg:observable:vh_significance_dijetmass", "hepkg:observable:vh_stxs_xsec_br", "hepkg:observable:wh_significance", "hepkg:observable:zh_significance", "hypothesis", "intervals", "joint", "leptons", "m_bb", "multivariate", "observable", "one-dimensional", "production", "reduced", "regions", "rejection", "result_measures_observable", "signal", "significance", "smeft", "strength", "stxs", "times", "two-poi", "validation", "warsaw-basis", "wilson"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9479, "completion_tokens": 334, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 23.917127195745707, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 23.917127195745707, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9813.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupporte