{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b42948c6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many detector objects does analysis 2401.07090 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2401.07090 defines 9 detector objects:\n\n- B+ candidate\n- Companion muon (non-triggering muon in B+ -> K+ mu+ mu- candidate)\n- Dielectron vertex\n- Kaon candidate track\n- Low-pT (LP) electron\n- PF electron\n- Primary vertex (PV)\n- Trigger muon (B parking triggering muon)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2208.12095", "2304.08962", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2510.07527", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2401.07090"], "predicate": "result_defines_object"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:bplus_candidate", "hepkg:object:companion_muon", "hepkg:object:dielectron_vertex", "hepkg:object:kaon_track", "hepkg:object:lp_electron", "hepkg:object:pf_electron", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "hepkg:object:trigger_muon"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:09b14e3812368a08723736ea", "hepkg:evidence:21b8be8f1ace47fe5f80b923", "hepkg:evidence:392d3382ad025b23d8c1d075", "hepkg:evidence:7da5a98a46ca36b865f7e8cb", "hepkg:evidence:e049882fea07ce5c4f83c703", "hepkg:evidence:f7980e5f47ac0e2618c7237d"], "seen_values": ["2401.0709", "2401.07090", "candidate", "companion", "detector_object", "dielectron", "electron", "hepkg:object:bplus_candidate", "hepkg:object:companion_muon", "hepkg:object:dielectron_vertex", "hepkg:object:kaon_track", "hepkg:object:lp_electron", "hepkg:object:pf_electron", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "hepkg:object:trigger_muon", "kaon", "low-pt", "mu-", "muon", "non-triggering", "parking", "primary", "result_defi