{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b54eb27f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2109.13808 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2109.13808 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $WW$ background\n- $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background\n- Non-WW diboson background (WZ/gamma*, ZZ/gamma*, Wgamma, Zgamma)\n- Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)\n- Top-quark pair and single-top (ttbar, Wt) background\n- VBF Higgs production treated as background (ggF+2jets analysis)\n- W+jets and multijet background with misidentified leptons\n- ggF Higgs production treated as background (VBF analysis)\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2109.13808.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2109.13808", "2208.12095", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2109.13808"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:ttbar_wt", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:z_jets"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:336d63a280c44f0503903e7e", "hepkg:evidence:50c1cdfb2b87c50370c1bc41", "hepkg:evidence:67006b49eaeb94b3b2818baf", "hepkg:evidence:90250b0c339a12dd47ce2034", "hepkg:evidence:c042b3b94700d10310baaa40", "hepkg:evidence:cb14cd5a3fbee7e4f590cf95"], "seen_values": ["2", "2109.13808", "analysis", "and", "background", "decays", "diboson", "gamma", "ggf", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:ttbar_wt", "