{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b5b2c8ad", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2103.06956 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.06956 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Electroweak vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n- Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\n- Higgs boson decay to two photons (H→γγ)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a single top quark (tH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH)\n\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.019}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:h_to_diphoton", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:196aa3fe188369af007527cf", "hepkg:evidence:36dfb8da205d7005ec594389", "hepkg:evidence:783d74194d0229287f874b68", "hepkg:evidence:b5b9cdc4461538906711b439"], "seen_values": ["2103.06956", "association", "boson", "decay", "electroweak", "fusion", "ggh", "gluon", "hepkg:process:ggh", "hepkg:process:h_to_diphoton", "hepkg:process:th", "hepkg:process:tth", "hepkg:process:vbf", "hepkg:process:vh", "higgs", "pair", "photons", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_targets_process", "single", "top", "tth", "two", "vbf", "vector", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9047, "completion_tokens": 167, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 13.229501499794424, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 13.229501499794424, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9214.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 6.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b5d88f01", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2211.08028 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $E_{\\text{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ soft-term reconstruction uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}$ initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty\n- Heavy-flavour content uncertainty in W/Z+jets background\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- Jet mass scale (JMS) uncertainty\n- Kinematic (m_eff) reweighting procedure uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction, identification, and isolation efficiency uncertainty\n- MC background sample statistical (limited-event) uncertainty\n- Normalisation uncertainty on $t\\bar{t}+W/Z/H$, $t\\bar{t} t\\bar{t}$, and diboson backgrounds (uncorrelated across regions)\n- Parton distribution function (PDF) uncertainty\n- SUSY signal cross-section uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scale, PDF, alpha_s variation)\n- Single-top / $t\\bar{t}$ interference modelling uncertainty (Wt-$t\\bar{t}$)\n- Single-top production cross-section uncertainty\n- Single-top radiation modelling uncertainty (Pythia 8.230 variations)\n- Total single-top modelling uncertainty impact on total yields\n- Total theoretical uncertainty in $t\\bar{t}$ background estimation (sum in quadrature of PS, ISR/FSR, ME generator)\n- Uncertainty on fraction of $t\\bar{t}$ events with additional heavy-flavour jets ($t\\bar{t}+>=1b$, $t\\bar{t}+>=1c$)\n- W/Z+jets factorisation/renormalisation scale and ME-PS matching uncertainty\n- b tagging (and mistag) efficiency calibration uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}$ hadronisation and parton-shower modelling uncertainty (Herwig vs Pythia)\n- $t\\bar{t}$ matrix-element generator choice uncertainty (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO vs Powheg Box)\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis and affect various aspects of the measurement.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:btagging", "hepkg:systematic:jer", "hepkg:systematic:jes", "hepkg:systematic:jms", "hepkg:systematic:kinematic-reweighting", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-reco-id-iso", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:met-soft-term", "hepkg:systematic:pdf", "hepkg:systematic:signal-cross-section", "hepkg:systematic:single-top-cross-section", "hepkg:systematic:single-top-radiation", "hepkg:systematic:single-top-total", "hepkg:systematic:single-top-ttbar-interference", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-hadronisation-parton-shower", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-heavy-flavor-fraction", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-isr-fsr", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-me-generator", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-theory-total", "hepkg:systematic:ttbarx-tttt-diboson-normalization", "hepkg:systematic:wz-jets-heavy-flavor-content", "hepkg:systematic:wz-jets-scale-matching"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:01fb4d2faf3bc2134195d54b", "hepkg:evidence:2fbc74cf23e868ede88b4376", "hepkg:evidence:30ecc055f2430e5b6a3c179d", "hepkg:evidence:3183ba86ca75c5541e94e844", "hepkg:evidence:3bd92182a11e8126b8d8df6c", "hepkg:evidence:40b913abf0dd1238ceb5243f", "hepkg:evidence:473ec44