{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b7395477", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many background-estimation methods does analysis 2004.14060 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2004.14060 uses three background-estimation methods:\n\n1. Control-region-based background normalisation via simultaneous profile likelihood fit\n2. Data-driven jet smearing technique using single-jet trigger data\n3. Fixed simulation prediction normalised to the most accurate theoretical cross section\n\nTherefore, the analysis uses **three** background-estimation methods.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2012.01581", "2207.12246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 2, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.14060"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:asymptotic_formulae", "hepkg:method:cls_prescription", "hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization", "hepkg:method:discovery_fit", "hepkg:method:fixed_mc_prediction", "hepkg:method:jet_smearing", "hepkg:method:profile_likelihood_fit"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0139a742de0beb0186d6090a", "hepkg:evidence:39319be88a0e7a9800386cc6", "hepkg:evidence:4b423c1ef5593f4febd8bc8c", "hepkg:evidence:6d97bf6e3d9730abaa6f2ebe", "hepkg:evidence:7258a8924d7a28227ac6f162", "hepkg:evidence:8648b5930ae6cd702905f833", "hepkg:evidence:8af653d73f5aeac1b45b7552", "hepkg:evidence:c29ea653f230504eea27a1f4"], "seen_values": ["2004.1406", "2004.14060", "accurate", "and", "asymptotic", "background", "background-only", "background_method", "background_uses_method", "binned", "calculation", "cl_s", "control-region-based", "cross", "data", "data-driven", "discovery", "exclusion", "fit", "fits", "fixed", "for", "formulae", "free-floating", "hepkg:method:asymptotic_formulae", "hepkg:method:cls_prescription", "hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization", "hepkg:method:discovery_fit", "hepkg:method:fixed_mc_prediction", "hepkg:method:jet_smearing", "hepkg:method:profile_likelihood_fit", "jet", "likelihood", "limit", "most", "normalisation", "normalised", "prediction", "prescription", "profile", "profile-likelihood-ratio", "result_uses_statistical_method", "section", "setting", "signal", "simulation", "simultaneous", "single-jet", "smearing", "statistical_method", "strength", "technique", "test", "theoretical", "trigger", "using", "via", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 3, "prompt_tokens": 14044, "completion_tokens": 499, "rounds": 3, "seconds": 38.44375138403848, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 38.44375138403848, "llm_calls": 3.0, "tokens": 14543.0, "rounds": 3.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 2.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 7.0, "evidence_quotes": 8.0}}
{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48447", "qid": "gen-paper-b739c2ad", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2407.10549 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2407.10549 reports 12 systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $E_T^{miss}$ trigger efficiency, energy scale and resolution uncertainty (found negligible)\n- $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ matching parameter and resummation scale uncertainty\n- $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ normalization uncertainty\n- $Z\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ modeling uncertainty\n- $b$-jet identification algorithm calibration uncertainty\n- $tW$ channel interference with $t\\\\bar{t}$ production uncertainty (diagram subtraction scheme)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) and jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet mass scale (JMS) uncertainty for large-$R$ jets\n- Lepton identification efficiency uncertainty (found negligible)\n- Matrix element and parton shower generator choice uncertainty\n- PDF choice and factorization/renormalization scale uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2407.10549 reports 12 systematic uncertainties, including $E_T^{miss}$ trigger efficiency, $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ matching parameter and resummation scale uncertainty, $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ normalization uncertainty, $Z\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ modeling uncertainty, $b$-jet identification algorithm calibration uncertainty, $tW$ channel interference with $t\\\\bar{t}$ production uncertainty, integrated luminosity uncertainty, jet energy scale and jet energy resolution uncertainty, jet mass scale uncertainty for large-$R$ jets, lepton identification efficiency uncertainty, matrix element and parton shower generator choice uncertainty, and PDF choice and factorization/renormalization scale uncertainty.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2407.10549"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:btag-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:etmiss-trigger-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer", "hepkg:systematic:jms-large-r-jet", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-id-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:me-parton-shower-generator-choice", "hepkg:systematic:pdf-scale-choice", "hepkg:systematic:tw-ttbar-interference", "hepkg:systematic:vjets-matching-resummation-scale", "hepkg:systematic:vjets-normalization", "hepkg:systematic:zjets-modeling"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0cde5056b062613e8fb1fa2d", "hepkg:evidence:24c4ac8ab672a6375d3a3d62", "hepkg:evidence:42d8be438a5a02118f32eaa8", "hepkg:evidence:a3c555c2747de4863a6e00ce", "hepkg:evidence:aded7ebab1919d59a4197885", "hepkg:evidence:ccc530643ca3e4bf7d131127", "hepkg:evidence:fac00cc858678aebcee0377f"], "seen_values": ["-jet", "2407.10549", "algorithm", "and", "bar", "calibration", "channel", "choice", "diagram", "e_t", "efficiency", "element", "energy", "factorization", "for", "found", "generator", "hepkg:systematic:btag-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:etmiss-trigger-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer", "hepkg:systematic:jms-large-r-jet", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-id-efficiency", "hep